content.text:
I pulled the open roles from Cloudflare's careers job board (the Greenhouse API behind cloudflare.com/careers), which listed 435 jobs. 62 of them mention "Rust" in the description. These 5 are the first engineering roles that matched. The board's own location field only says "Hybrid" or "In-Office", so I took the real locations from each job's office list.

```json
[
  {
    "title": "Engineering Manager, Cloudflare Network Interconnect",
    "location": ["Austin, TX"],
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8083701?gh_jid=8083701"
  },
  {
    "title": "Engineering Manager - Workers Runtime, Edge Team",
    "location": ["Austin, TX", "Lisbon, Portugal", "London, United Kingdom", "Seattle, WA"],
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/7653558?gh_jid=7653558"
  },
  {
    "title": "Principal Software Engineer, Workers Deploy & Config",
    "location": ["Austin, TX"],
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8055320?gh_jid=8055320"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Distributed Systems Engineer",
    "location": ["Austin, TX"],
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8066716?gh_jid=8066716"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Distributed Systems Engineer - Cache",
    "location": ["Atlanta, GA", "Austin, TX", "Champaign, IL", "New York, NY", "San Francisco, CA", "Seattle, WA", "Washington, DC"],
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8163523?gh_jid=8163523"
  }
]
```

- **Rust match:** I only checked that the word "Rust" appears in the job description. I didn't read each posting to see whether Rust is required or just listed among other languages.
- **Title filter:** I kept titles containing "Engineer", "Developer" or "Architect", so two of the five are engineering manager roles.
- **Work arrangement:** The first and last roles are marked "Hybrid" on the board. The other three are marked "In-Office".

